            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "与蒙德城不同的风景，对我来说很有新鲜感。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901511"
            ]
          },
          "9901511": {
            "id": "9901511",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "练习唱歌的时候，也可以放开歌喉。不用担心万一打扰到了别人该怎么办。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901512"
            ]
          },
          "9901512": {
            "id": "9901512",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "芭芭拉的歌声不能说是打扰吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901513"
            ]
          },
          "9901513": {
            "id": "9901513",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "唔…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901514"
            ]
          },
          "9901514": {
            "id": "9901514",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "谢谢你能这样说。但我…还是要多考虑点别人的感受嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901515"
            ]
          },
          "9901515": {
            "id": "9901515",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "总之，我很开心能收到你的邀请。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901516"
            ]
          },
          "9901516": {
            "id": "9901516",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那就太好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901517"
            ]
          },
          "9901517": {
            "id": "9901517",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "嗯，我很开心能收到你的邀请。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901518"
            ]
          },
          "9901518": {
            "id": "9901518",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "我还想在这里多待一会儿。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901519"
            ]
          },
          "9901519": {
            "id": "9901519",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "想一起聊聊天吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901520"
            ]
          },
          "9901520": {
            "id": "9901520",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "啊，好的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901521"
            ]
          },
          "9901521": {
            "id": "9901521",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "嘿嘿…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901522"
            ]
          },
          "9901522": {
            "id": "9901522",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你怎么突然笑了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901523"
            ]
          },
          "9901523": {
            "id": "9901523",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "想到什么有趣的事情了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901524"
            ]
          },
          "9901524": {
            "id": "9901524",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "啊，我刚刚意识到，自己很久没有像现在这样，轻轻松松地和朋友聊天。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901525"
            ]
          },
          "9901525": {
            "id": "9901525",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "突然就觉得很幸福。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901526"
            ]
          },
          "9901526": {
            "id": "9901526",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "芭芭拉很容易满足啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901527"
            ]
          },
          "9901527": {
            "id": "9901527",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "唔，唔，是这样吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901528"
            ]
          },
          "9901528": {
            "id": "9901528",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "好像，这也不是什么坏事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901529"
            ]
          },
          "9901529": {
            "id": "9901529",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "很容易就感到幸福的话，就会有很多的能量，然后就可以把幸福的感觉传递给别人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901530"
            ]
          },
          "9901530": {
            "id": "9901530",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "因为芭芭拉总是在为别人考虑。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901531"
            ]
          },
          "9901531": {
            "id": "9901531",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "那也是理所当然的嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901532"
            ]
          },
          "9901532": {
            "id": "9901532",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "我一直受到着大家的照顾，我也想用自己的努力来回应这些善意。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901533"
            ]
          },
          "9901533": {
            "id": "9901533",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "真不愧是芭芭拉啊。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901534"
            ]
          },
          "9901534": {
            "id": "9901534",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "唔，你不要总是夸我啦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901535"
            ]
          },
          "9901535": {
            "id": "9901535",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "有批评…才会有进步，对吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901536"
            ]
          },
          "9901536": {
            "id": "9901536",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "有什么想做的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901537"
            ]
          },
          "9901537": {
            "id": "9901537",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "啊，我最近练习了一首新的曲子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901538"
            ]
          },
          "9901538": {
            "id": "9901538",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "但有些细节我还把握不好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901539"
            ]
          },
          "9901539": {
            "id": "9901539",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "副歌在重复的时候要不要升个调，舞步有没有优化的空间…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901540"
            ]
          },
          "9901540": {
            "id": "9901540",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "如果不麻烦你的话，我希望你能看我的表演，再给我一些建议。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901541"
            ]
          },
          "9901541": {
            "id": "9901541",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我会为你「全力应援」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901542"
            ]
          },
          "9901542": {
            "id": "9901542",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "这是我的荣幸。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901543"
            ]
          },
          "9901543": {
            "id": "9901543",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "谢谢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901544"
            ]
          },
          "9901544": {
            "id": "9901544",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "唔…如果有不成熟的地方，不要笑话我哦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901545"
            ]
          },
          "9901545": {
            "id": "9901545",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "我思考过很多次，现在是鼓起勇气，才敢在那么近的地方表演给你看的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901546"
            ]
          },
          "9901546": {
            "id": "9901546",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "要是你笑话我的话，我都不知道要往哪里躲…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901547"
            ]
          },
          "9901547": {
            "id": "9901547",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不会的，放心吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901548"
            ]
          },
          "9901548": {
            "id": "9901548",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我相信你哦，芭芭拉也要相信自己。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901549"
            ]
          },
          "9901549": {
            "id": "9901549",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "呼…好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901550"
            ]
          },
          "9901550": {
            "id": "9901550",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "那么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "9901551"
            ]
          },
          "9901551": {
            "id": "9901551",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "芭芭拉",
            "text": "演唱，开始！"
          }
        }
      }
